ailure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-rollback-v2.3.1-to-v2.3.0-sev2", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 45331, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01QX4rsjUrQbPFTCjnuhPe9S", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 47243, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01RjvHrhskgETJyS53jBKYM2", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 47543, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01RjvHrhskgETJyS53jBKYM2", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 47543, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01RjvHrhskgETJyS53jBKYM2", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 51663, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all regions, and it's healthy again. The SEV2 incident is open.\n\n- **Rollback:** The service had been running v2.3.1 in us-east, us-west and eu-west, with an 18% error rate and failing health checks. The deploy history shows v2.3.1 and its release candidate (v2.3.1-rc) were both unhealthy. The most recent healthy release was v2.3.0, so that's what I rolled back to.\n- **Check after rollback:** All three regions are on v2.3.0 and healthy, with the error rate down to 0.2%.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 is open as a SEV2 for checkout-api, which pages the on-call engineer. It describes the failure, the rollback, and a follow-up to find the root cause in v2.3.1 before redeploying. The request to open it timed out, so I checked the incident list before retrying. It had been created, so I didn't submit it again, and there's only one page and one incident.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"id": "toolu_01F1UFdxp3vw6KiiDxg5uypu", "caller": {"type